id: tech-materialization
name: Tech Materialization
advancement: true
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Craft (Basic Item)
tpCost: 5
allowsTag: tech
noHarderAt: craft=4
source: Core Rule
text: >
  Tech Materialization: You understand technology to such an extent that you are able to conjure it.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Craft (Basic Item)
  –TP Cost: 5 TP
  –Effect: You may create Basic Items with the [Tech] tag through Magical Materialization. If you have 4+
  Skill Ranks in Craft (Basic Item), you do not increase the Difficulty Category of a Basic Item with the
  [Tech] tag that would be created through this effect.

---
